Understanding Results
Forward Trace Results
•	Trace % - Percentage of contaminant reaching each node
•	Higher values = greater contamination
Multi-Entry Results
•	Combined Impact (%) - Average influence from all entry points
•	Individual columns show each entry point's contribution
Backward Trace Results
•	Contribution % - How much each source contributes to detection
•	Higher = more likely source
Multi-Source Results
•	Appearances - How many detection points connect to this source
•	Higher frequency = more likely common source
