Troubleshooting
"No results" after running
•	Ensure at least one point is selected
•	For multi-point modes, need at least 2 points
Plot doesn't update
•	Check if table is hiding the view
•	Try toggling table off/on
Can't click nodes
•	Make sure you're in the right mode
•	Click directly on blue nodes
Export fails
•	Run analysis first (no data to export otherwise)
•	Check write permissions for chosen folder


